        "convective_precipitation_mm_per_hour": 3.0,
        "formula": "handoff = (bilinear(r1) * 1800.0 + bilinear(r2) * 1800.0) / 1200.0 with dtt = dt / 3 = 1200 s for 20-minute lead/offset halves, matching the #71 oracle arithmetic applied to the resolver-derived rate grids."
